Modifications in this fork (see README for detail):
  - Every property-scoped tool accepts an optional site_url, so one server
    process can cover an entire Search Console account rather than the single
    property named by GSC_SITE_URL. (Addresses upstream issue #9.)
  - New list_properties tool exposing sites.list at runtime.
  - The resolved property is reported in each tool's response metadata.
  - A configured default property is no longer required when callers pass
    site_url explicitly.
  - Renamed from suganthan-gsc-mcp to gsc-mcp-remote.

